To test navigation, import `RouterTestingModule` or use `provideRouter` with dummy routes. Then inject `Router` and `Location`:

```typescript
TestBed.configureTestingModule({
  imports: [RouterTestingModule.withRoutes([...])]
});
router = TestBed.inject(Router);
location = TestBed.inject(Location);

router.navigate(['/test']).then(() => {
  expect(location.path()).toBe('/test');
});
```

This lets you verify that navigation works correctly without actually loading route components (unless you want to).
